#. copy/sourceLead
#: src/js/chronicle.js:12
msgctxt "tree:copy#/sourceLead"
msgid ""
"The main-branch revision and the functional change may coincide, but must "
"not be confused. Ordinary and squash commits need one record; a mechanical "
"merge also lists its second-parent change."
msgstr "主分岐版と機能変更は重なる場合があっても混同しない。通常・squash commit は一件、機械的 merge commit は第二親の変更主題を別記する。"

