#. copy/mergeNote
#: src/js/chronicle.js:12
msgctxt "tree:copy#/mergeNote"
msgid ""
"This record entered main through a GitHub merge commit; its second parent "
"preserves the human-readable change subject."
msgstr "この頁は GitHub merge commit で主分岐へ入ったため、第二親に人間可読の変更主題を保存する。"

